{"completed": true, "response": "{\"understanding\":\"当下像是一开始就带着已经存在的情绪进入：先明显显露出来，随即把外露程度收低，但体验本身没有中断，仍连续往前。这里最值得保留的是“显露后收住、但不撤回”的状态形态，而不是替它补一个尚不存在的来历。\",\"why_now\":{\"earlier_fact\":\"首段，尚无已建立History，不能据此指定此前发生过什么。\",\"bridge\":\"目前没有可用的前史来构成因果桥；只能确认当前体验自身呈现为强烈出现后收敛，同时保持连续。\",\"current\":\"开头的明确力度随即减弱，而跨三小节的连续线条没有被切断，因此更像外显强度在回收，而不是感受被取消或改向。\",\"without\":\"这是首段，没有前述事实可删；因此本段不声称当前状态是由某件既往经历造成的，也不伪造一个原因。\"},\"used\":[],\"new_history\":[],\"self_check\":{\"history_effective\":true,\"pseudo_cause\":false,\"music_as_external_fact\":false,\"generic\":false,\"note\":\"没有History可用于真正的因果解释，因此明确保留因果空缺；只描述本段建立的体验形态，不把力度变化解释成外部回应、决定或关系变化，也暂不把它固化成以后可调用的心理事实。\"}}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "953523ff-d742-4598-9a30-11be0ead72d7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T214205281263Z", "elapsed_seconds": 15.234, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T21:42:20.517324+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "05917a214fa92004a40526d0c78c674e10bc5bcabf74056f57193a0cacd73f4d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f0